Follow `AGENTS.md` at the repository root.

Detailed rules live in `.claude/rules/` and multi-step workflows in `.claude/skills/<name>/SKILL.md`. Read the file that `AGENTS.md` maps to your task before you implement it. Do not copy those files into `.cursor/`; edit them in `.claude/` so every agent stays in sync.
